---
import { MagpieToolkit } from "../landing/MagpieCard";
---
<figure class="airflow-chart-story">
  <div class="chart-frame"><div class="chart-phases"><span>Before the AI boom</span><span>The AI boom</span><span class="chart-adoption"><MagpieToolkit /><span>Magpie introduced</span></span></div>
  <svg viewBox="0 0 900 330" role="img" aria-labelledby="airflow-flow-title airflow-flow-desc">
    <title id="airflow-flow-title">More incoming reports, less manual work per report</title>
    <desc id="airflow-flow-desc">Illustrative trends, not measured maintainer hours. Incoming external reports rise. Manual maintainer time per report falls after adopting Magpie. A hypothetical continuation without Magpie branches at adoption and keeps maintainer time high. The shaded gap represents illustrative time saved for maintainers, who retain review and approval.</desc>
    <rect class="chart-wash" x="600" y="0" width="300" height="330" />
    <line class="phase-divider" x1="300" x2="300" y1="0" y2="330" />
    <line class="adoption-line" x1="600" x2="600" y1="0" y2="330" />
    <path class="saved-time-area" d="M600 145 C690 145 775 114 855 110 L855 275 C700 255 700 145 600 145 Z" />
    <path class="incoming-line" d="M45 140 C130 140 210 140 300 140 C410 140 490 80 600 65 S775 40 855 35" />
    <path class="without-line" d="M600 145 C690 145 775 114 855 110" />
    <path class="manual-history" d="M45 205 C130 205 210 205 300 205 C410 205 490 145 600 145" />
    <path class="time-line" d="M600 145 C700 145 700 255 855 275" />
    <circle class="incoming-dot" cx="855" cy="35" r="5" />
    <circle class="without-dot" cx="855" cy="110" r="5" />
    <circle class="time-dot" cx="855" cy="275" r="5" />
    <text class="curve-label incoming-label" x="855" y="21" text-anchor="end">Incoming external reports</text>
    <text class="curve-label without-label" x="855" y="84" text-anchor="end"><tspan x="855">Maintainer time</tspan><tspan x="855" dy="19">without Magpie</tspan></text>
    <text class="curve-label time-label" x="855" y="301" text-anchor="end"><tspan x="855">Maintainer time</tspan><tspan x="855" dy="19">with Magpie</tspan></text>
    <text class="saved-time-label" x="790" y="180" text-anchor="middle"><tspan x="790">Time back</tspan><tspan x="790" dy="23">for maintainers</tspan></text>

  </svg></div>
  <p class="saved-time-caption">Shaded area: time back for maintainers</p>

  <p class="chart-note"><span>Illustrative scenario</span> <a href="/stories/airflow#data" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">View data</a></p>
</figure>
<style>
.airflow-chart-story{--incoming:#b4483d;--time:#005bbb;--without:#936000;margin:0 auto;max-width:900px;color:var(--ink)}
:global(html[data-theme=dark]) .airflow-chart-story{--incoming:#f19b91;--time:#91c4ff;--without:#e5bd70}
.chart-phases{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));align-items:center;text-align:center;margin-bottom:20px;min-height:44px;font-size:17px;color:var(--muted)}.phase-divider{stroke:var(--muted);stroke-dasharray:3 6;opacity:.25}.chart-adoption{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:12px;color:var(--time);font-size:18px;font-weight:500;margin-bottom:0}.chart-adoption :global(.magpie-toolkit){width:44px;height:39px;color:inherit}
.airflow-chart-story>svg{display:block;width:100%;overflow:visible}.chart-wash{fill:var(--time);opacity:.06}.adoption-line{stroke:var(--time);stroke-dasharray:3 6;opacity:.5}.incoming-line,.time-line,.without-line,.manual-history{fill:none;stroke-width:4;stroke-linecap:round}.incoming-line{stroke:var(--incoming);stroke-dasharray:9 7}.time-line{stroke:var(--time)}.manual-history{stroke:var(--without)}.without-label{fill:var(--without)}.without-line{stroke:var(--without);stroke-dasharray:2 7}.without-dot{fill:var(--without)}.saved-time-area{fill:var(--time);opacity:.16}.saved-time-caption{display:none}.saved-time-label{fill:var(--time);font-size:17px;font-weight:600}.incoming-dot{fill:var(--incoming)}.time-dot{fill:var(--time)}.incoming-label,.time-label{font-size:20px;font-weight:500}.incoming-label{fill:var(--incoming)}.time-label{fill:var(--time)}.period-label{fill:var(--muted);font-size:15px}
figcaption{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:8px;text-align:center;margin:24px 0 0}figcaption strong{font-weight:500;font-size:25px;letter-spacing:-.025em}figcaption span{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted)}.chart-note{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;text-align:center;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin:18px 0 0}.chart-note a{color:inherit;text-underline-offset:3px}
.chart-phases .chart-adoption{gap:8px}
@media(max-width:700px){.chart-phases{font-size:12px;gap:8px}.chart-phases .chart-adoption{font-size:12px;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}.chart-phases .chart-adoption :global(.magpie-toolkit){width:30px;height:27px}.chart-adoption{font-size:16px}.incoming-label,.time-label{font-size:29px}.period-label{font-size:22px}figcaption strong{font-size:23px}figcaption span{font-size:15px}.chart-note{font-size:11px}.airflow-chart-story>svg{margin-block:24px}}

.chart-legend{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px 24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px}.chart-legend>span{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}.chart-legend>span:before{content:'';width:28px;border-top:3px solid var(--time)}.chart-legend .legend-incoming:before{border-color:var(--incoming);border-top-style:dashed}
.chart-legend .legend-without:before{border-color:var(--without);border-top-style:dotted}
.chart-frame{border:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 18%,transparent);border-radius:14px;overflow:hidden;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--paper) 35%,transparent)}.chart-phases{margin:0;min-height:78px;gap:0;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 18%,transparent);font-size:16px}.chart-phases>span{display:flex;height:100%;align-items:center;justify-content:center;padding:12px;border-right:1px solid color-mix(in srgb,var(--ink) 18%,transparent)}.chart-phases>span:last-child{border-right:0;background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--time) 6%,transparent)}.chart-adoption{font-size:16px}.chart-frame>svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.phase-divider,.adoption-line{stroke:var(--muted);stroke-dasharray:none;opacity:.18}.chart-note{margin-top:16px}
@media(max-width:700px){.chart-legend{flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:13px;margin-bottom:20px}.chart-phases{font-size:12px;min-height:72px}.chart-phases>span{padding:10px 6px}.chart-frame{border-radius:10px}.chart-frame>svg{min-height:150px}.chart-phases .chart-adoption{font-size:12px}.saved-time-label{display:none}.saved-time-caption{display:block;text-align:center;color:var(--time);font-size:14px;font-weight:600;margin:16px 0 0}}
.curve-label{font-size:16px;font-weight:500}
@media(max-width:700px){.curve-label{font-size:22px}.chart-frame>svg{min-height:180px}}
</style>
